{
  "name": "E-commerce Voice Agent | Vapi Order Status + Returns",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Note s1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## E-commerce Voice Agent (Vapi + n8n)\n**During the call** Vapi calls this webhook with a tool call:\n- `check_order_status` reads the **Orders** tab and answers live\n- `request_return` checks eligibility and adds a row to **Returns**\n\n**After the call** the end-of-call report is turned into a row in the **Calls** tab (OpenAI pulls name, order, intent, summary).\n\nSheet: E-commerce Voice Agent Demo (sample data).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 330,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Vapi Ecom Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -440,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vapi-ecom",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "7f660125-b744-48e8-837c-a3817731bfab"
    },
    {
